          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.54,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "And then in this file you can store your class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 50.01,
          "en": "And we do this, we split the code across multiple files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.01,
          "end": 53.31,
          "en": "to keep every file readable and maintainable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.31,
          "end": 56.64,
          "en": "so that all these files are relatively lean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.64,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "and don't contain endless amounts of code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "But you instead just have one main thing per file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
